          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "8 points Why don't we need the equivalent of frame axioms in the STRIPS planning representation?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 15,
          "bbox": [
            0.175,
            0.703,
            0.82,
            0.759
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "We do not need frame axioms because STRIPS planners assume that the world is static except for the effects explicitly specified by the action descriptions."
            }
          ]
